<view class="page feedback">
  <view class="card">
    <view class="list-row">
      <view class="row-text">
        <text class="t-body">音效</text>
        <text class="t-caption">点宠物、摸头、进食、打卡成功。很短，很轻。</text>
      </view>
      <switch checked="{{sound}}" color="#B84E0C" bindchange="onSound"></switch>
    </view>
    <view class="list-row list-row-last">
      <view class="row-text">
        <text class="t-body">触感震动</text>
        <text class="t-caption">点宠物时轻轻震一下。</text>
      </view>
      <switch checked="{{haptics}}" color="#B84E0C" bindchange="onHaptics"></switch>
    </view>
  </view>
  <view class="note"><text class="t-caption">默认静音。系统静音开关打开时，也不会出声。</text></view>
</view>
